        {
          "title": "还原致命的原子弹实验事故",
          "content": "<p>1946年，负责制造原子弹的美国洛斯阿拉莫斯实验室，发生了一起致命事故。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202307/bg2023072903.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>核物理学家路易斯·斯洛廷，带人参观实验室。他决定演示一下，原子弹的“关键组件”。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202307/bg2023072904.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>他用螺丝刀将铍半球支撑在钚核上。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202307/bg2023072905.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>但是，螺丝刀一滑，铍半球落到了钚核上方，引发了辐射反应。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202307/bg2023072906.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>他立刻用手将两者分开，导致自己受到了致命辐射，九天后就去世了。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202307/bg2023072907.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>下面是一个英国艺术家使用各种模型材料，重新还原的事故现场。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202307/bg2023072908.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202307/bg2023072909.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "还原致命的原子弹实验事故",
              "url": "https://www.bbc.com/future/article/20230725-making-the-blue-flash-how-i-reconstructed-a-fatal-atomic-accident"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202307/bg2023072903.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202307/bg2023072904.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202307/bg2023072905.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202307/bg2023072906.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202307/bg2023072907.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202307/bg2023072908.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202307/bg2023072909.webp"
          ]
        }
      ]
