          "title": "问",
          "content": "<p>：如果网速提高到 1Tb/s，互联网会怎样？</p>\n<p>答：会有更多、更大、更快的广告。</p>\n<p>-- <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=41332413\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Hacker News 读者</a></p>",
          "links": [
